---
description: Dockerfile and Compose hardening for this stack
globs: "Dockerfile*,docker-compose*.yml,docker-compose*.yaml,.dockerignore"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Compose as it is
- Publish only the console port. db, sonar-db, and SonarQube 9000 stay on the Compose network. Sonar is reached through the console at /sonar/.
- Do not add docker-compose.override.yml to the production -f list. Override publishes 8091 for development. Production binds 127.0.0.1.
- privileged: true is only host-setup, and that service only sets vm.max_map_count. Do not add other host changes there.
- The console does not mount docker.sock. The scanner service does.
- Secret files live in secrets/ and are Compose secrets or read-only binds. They stay out of git.
- Pin image tags when you bump them. Digest pins are better when you next touch an image line. Do not use latest.
- There is no nginx config in this repo. If you add one, TLS terminates there, the proxy is the only TRUSTED_PROXIES entry, and logs must not store Authorization or cookies.

# Dockerfile
- Multi-stage Node build, then python:3.12-slim. The process drops to uid 10001. Do not copy secrets into the image.
